{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1527315-cofd-anthology","id":1527315,"title":"CofD Anthology","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-12-23T11:54:28-08:00","id":1527315,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> CofD Anthology","content":"Just a basic question, if you could choose one (or more if you want) a given story involving CofD to be adapted in some media what type of story would it be? Making it clear that it is supposed to be like a One-shot, basically a story with a beginning, middle and end in one chapter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-23T13:59:35-08:00","id":1527329,"title":"","content":"I'm always up for more Werewolf media in general, but I kind of doubt a Forsaken movie would do well, they are too much outside of the expectation for werewolves. Sin Eater would probably be a good one, no preconceived notions and it would be simple enough to explain quickly to an audience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-23T16:18:13-08:00","id":1527336,"title":"","content":"I think that if it were to comprehensively cover any of the games in a series it would be more viable, although that was not the intention of the question.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-24T05:18:41-08:00","id":1527365,"title":"","content":"I'd rather like a mockumentary, be it singular or part of a series, covering one (or more, if numerous/long enough) of the gamelines, particularly Beast, Changeling, Demon, Deviant or Promethean since they're my favourites.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":". 12-29-2023, 05:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-01T15:57:16-08:00","id":1527718,"title":"","content":"Some stories that I thought might be interesting to see in some way, and interesting is a very subjective word in this case:<br /> <br /> A pack of Uratha facing an incarnate beast, preferably a tyrannical Anakim, and in the end the battle is won with heavy losses. It would be interesting to watch in an animation a pack facing a larger creature like a Chinese dragon or a larger-scale werewolf.<br /> <br /> An account of a boy who was the son of a wizard and his father created a being using alchemy to be an almost mother to him, over time and watching him grow she develops emotions becoming a promethean, I know it's not exactly That's how it works, but would it be interesting then to have poetic license?<br /> <br /> The account of a group of friends who went camping, one of them is uncomfortable, out of nowhere they are attacked by something they cannot identify (A uratha, beast, vampire or other creature they can fit), one by one they are hunted and slaughtered , finally one of them survives, remembering lessons from his father who was a hunter and with luck defeats the creature, but the experience changes him.<br /> <br /> A police officer a few years away from retirement, who is discouraged and disbelieves in people, until one night, because of his partner or by chance, he becomes involved with the supernatural, here there are several ways to advance, in the end he is offered a chance to change his entire life, perhaps becoming a ghoul or Sadikh.<br /> <br /> Maybe too specific or too general depending on who you ask, but I think you can get the general idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-01T16:26:46-08:00","id":1527722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</